Project Title:STUDENT ATTENDANCE MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
Description:
A web-based application for managing student attendance, maintaining records, and generating attendance reports efficiently.

Problem Statement:Many educational institutions still manage attendance manually, which is time-consuming and prone to errors. The Student Attendance Management System provides a digital solution to record, monitor, and manage attendance efficiently.
Requirements:
Student Registration
Faculty Login
Attendance Marking
Attendance Reports
Search Student Records
Admin Dashboard
